      "writtenOn": "2020-04-08T20:34:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The TCPC, PPC, and BC12 interrupts should be implemented in a separate CL. You will also need to create your own interrupt handlers in board/halvor/board.c - the volteer baseboard versions do not support the 3rd port interrupt.\n\nUse unique names such as halvor_tcpc_alert_event, halvor_ppc_interrupt, and halvor_bc12_interrupt for your interrupt handlers.  This way you can avoid having to move the volteer baseboard interrupt handlers.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 40,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 40,
        "endChar": 75
      },
      "revId": "d3d465a060b2e3dd46c32eae4dc0f6f74deb4671",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": true
    },
